      "message": "I still don\u0027t understand why we started getting the warning. You were able to confirm that it only started failure recently because you had to `repo sync` to see it. The [`CMakeLists.txt`](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blame/252f8fefe03db52f52fe8cecbb0029f265d6311b/kernel/CMakeLists.txt#L175-L182) check was [added in 2023](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/commit/3fbf12487c6c01c488210bc56b0f342f07098df9), so it\u0027s not new. I guess the only other thing that could have changed is one of the [`CONFIG_HEAP_MEM_POOL_ADD_SIZE_`](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blame/252f8fefe03db52f52fe8cecbb0029f265d6311b/kernel/CMakeLists.txt#L167) values. Were there any upstream changes recently that changed those?",
