      "message": "I added the explanation in the bug (https://b.corp.google.com/issues/416330651#comment7). This is the CL that introduced the change:\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/third_party/zephyr/+/6472692\n\nAll configs that start with CONFIG_HEAP_MEM_POOL_ADD_SIZE_* are added and compared against  CONFIG_HEAP_MEM_POOL_SIZE.\n\nThis is the script that does that from the CMakeLists.txt file:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyr/main/kernel/CMakeLists.txt;l\u003d179;bpv\u003d0",
